window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> best-selling Author Cora Kenborn comes a steamy friends-to-enemies-to-lovers story of revenge, redemption, and self-acceptance. </b></p> <p>She warned me she'd ruin me. </p> <p><i>I should've listened.</i></p> <p>Instead, I sacrificed my future for her and then spent seven years hating her for it. </p> <p>Now a scandalous fall from grace has landed her at my feet.</p> <p><i>Under my command.</i></p> <p>It's time to unleash the payback I've always craved.</p> <p>Unfortunately, revenge doesn't taste as sweet as the woman I vowed to destroy.</p> <p>Change of plans. </p> <p>I want more than her pain. </p> <p><i>I want her everything.</i></p>"; 
